## Title: Guild Name Ticker
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.5.0
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: Quickly set your represented guild name with /gt Some Name (creates a throwaway guild and selects it in the Character menu's Guild dropdown), or tick through a list of names on a timer.
